<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="topic" id="keyboard-shortcuts">
  <info>
    <link type="guide" xref="index"/>
    <desc>Keyboard shortcuts for the coyote application.</desc>
  </info>
  <title>Keys &amp; Shortcuts</title>
  <section id="help">
    <title>Help</title>
    <terms>
      <item><title><key>F1</key></title><p>Open the Overview.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Shift</key>+<key>F1</key></title><p>Arm Click for Help.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Escape</key></title><p>Cancel armed Click for Help. Otherwise Escape invokes Stop in the main window; support windows close or hide, and the Change Model search clears a non-empty query before cancelling.</p></item>
    </terms>
  </section>
  <section id="application">
    <title>Application</title>
    <terms>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>N</key></title><p>Open a new window.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>N</key></title><p>Create a new session.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>O</key></title><p>Open a session.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Q</key></title><p>Exit coyote.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>X</key></title><p>Cut the prompt selection.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>C</key></title><p>Copy the focused selection.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>V</key></title><p>Paste into the prompt.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>A</key></title><p>Select all in the focused area.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>,</key></title><p>Open Preferences.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Return</key> or <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Return</key></title><p>Send the prompt to the selected live agent; while that agent is active, this may be a steering message. Keypad Enter is also accepted.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>P</key></title><p>Pause the session.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>R</key></title><p>Resume the session.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>M</key></title><p>Change the model.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>1</key> … <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>6</key></title><p>Set thinking level Off through X-High.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>S</key></title><p>Choose a sandbox profile.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>C</key></title><p>Compact context.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>I</key></title><p>Show session stats.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>D</key></title><p>Deselect all in the focused prompt or conversation component.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>L</key></title><p>Clear the conversation.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>W</key></title><p>Close a support window.</p></item>
    </terms>
  </section>
  <section id="view">
    <title>View</title>
    <terms>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>M</key></title><p>Toggle markdown rendering.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Shift</key>+<key>A</key></title><p>Toggle auto-scroll.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>+</key> / <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>-</key></title><p>Zoom in or out.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>0</key></title><p>Reset zoom.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>j</key> / <key>k</key></title><p>Move one line down or up when a conversation text view has focus.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>g</key> / <key>G</key> (Shift+g)</title><p>Move to the top or bottom when a conversation text view has focus.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>D</key> / <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>U</key></title><p>Move one page down or up when a conversation text view has focus.</p></item>
      <item><title><key>Ctrl</key>+<key>A</key> / <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>C</key></title><p>Select all or copy in the focused area. Conversation selection commands remain local to the focused or retained conversation component.</p></item>
    </terms>
  </section>
  <section id="dialogs">
    <title>Dialogs and support windows</title>
    <p>Open Session and Sandbox Profile select their first available row and accept the selected row with Enter, keypad Enter, Space, or row activation. Change Model selects the first visible model; its search field receives initial focus, and Escape clears a non-empty query before cancelling an empty-query dialog.</p>
    <p>Preferences gives initial focus to Default model and uses Save as the default response. Its labels expose mnemonics for the editable controls; Escape cancels.</p>
    <p>Session Stats, Tool Call Details, and other transient support windows can be closed with Escape or Ctrl+W. Their visible Close actions remain available through normal Tab traversal and mnemonics.</p>
  </section>
</page>
